      "message": "How about below flow so we can totally dismiss \u0027goto\u0027?\nenergy_diff(eenv)\n  -\u003e set_env_before(eenv)\n       -\u003e compute_energy(eenv)\n            -\u003e sched_group_energy(eenv)\n  -\u003e set_env_after(eenv)\n       -\u003e compute_energy(eenv)\n            -\u003e sched_group_energy(eenv)",
      "parentUuid": "bb10c4b2_a8c5cc11",
