      "writtenOn": "2017-06-28T09:49:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is not that what we do right now?\n\nMain purpose here is to remove the double walking of the SDs hierarchy, which is where we get most of the speedup.",
      "parentUuid": "762d86fa_614130c7",
      "revId": "7e70501ce9797381262073463e9fa7f42978ce29",
