      "side": 1,
      "message": "While refactoring this.. seems this gating doesn\u0027t really belong here semantically, the caller should do it.\n\nBTW, pet peev: these shifts are throughout the kernel so maybe I\u0027m missing something but can we change this to a division?\n\nI\u0027d be really suprised if it hasn\u0027t compiled to the same instruction on every arch/compiler since like 1991.",
